# Test: the compiled native le binary judges owned consistency sources,
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# gives the same report inside and outside the selected root, and exposes
# the same findings through JSON and count.
#
# VALIDATES: native CLI/cwd/pipe behavior over one authored source with exactly
# one JSON-tag error and one missing-design warning, including exit status.
# PREVENTS: moving checkout inputs or repeated full-corpus scans from obscuring
# action plumbing failures. Independent production consistency gates still
# judge the complete live checkout.

option=timeout:value=300s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/le-consistency-answers
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
